.left-list-box{width: 30%;float: left;}
.bg-left{background:#b8b8b8;padding-bottom: 20px;}
.header-box-logo {background: #000;padding: 20px;}
.header-box-l {text-align: center; padding:10px 20px 0px;}
.header-box-l h3 {margin: 0px;font-size: 20px;margin-bottom: 10px;}
.header-box-l p{max-width: 300px;width: 100%;margin: auto;color: #000;font-size:16px;font-weight: 500;}
.header-box-l.left-contact h4 {margin: 0px;font-size: 25px;}
.header-box-l.left-contact p {font-size: 14px;}
.right-side-bar {width: 70%;float: right;padding:0px;}
span.vin, span.stock {width: 50%;float: left;}
.report-header-left.f-left {padding: 24px 10px;}
.odometer, .price {width: 44%;float: left;border: 1px solid #6c6b6b;margin: 15px 15px;   border-radius: 5px;text-align: center;height:225px;}
.odometer-inner img {max-width: 80px;}
.odometer-inner h4 {margin: 0px;font-weight: 700;font-size: 24px;padding: 0px;line-height: 29px;}
.price-inner h3{margin: 0px;font-weight: 700;font-size: 25px;padding: 0px;}
.odometer-inner p{margin: 0px;font-size: 32px;font-weight: 700;}
.price-inner {padding: 50px 0px;}
.price-inner p{font-size: 19px;font-weight: 400;margin:0px;line-height: 37px;}
.odometer-inner{padding: 40px 0px;}
.vehicle-detail {clear: both;margin: 30px 15px;float: left;width: 100%;}
.vehicle-detail h3 {margin: 0px;font-weight: 700;font-size: 25px;padding: 0px;line-height: 29px;border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;padding-bottom: 10px;width: 92%;}
ul.detail-block li {display: inline-block;width: 18%;float:left;text-align: center;border: 1px solid #6c6b6b;border-radius: 5px;margin: 0px 3px;padding: 10px 15px; height:120px;}
ul.detail-block li img {max-width: 50px;}
ul.detail-block {padding: 0px;float:left;width:100%;margin:5px 0px;}
ul.detail-block li h4 {margin: 0px;font-weight: 500;font-size: 14px;}
ul.detail-block li p {font-weight: 700;margin: 0px;padding-bottom: 11px;font-size: 13px;}
.financing-option {clear: both;margin: 30px 0px; float:left;width:100%;}
.financing-option h3 {background: #000;padding: 8px 15px;color: #fff;margin: 0px; text-transform:uppercase;}
.financing-option p {margin: 2px;font-size: 13px;padding: 0px 15px;}
.vehicle-Description.vehicle-detail p {margin: 2px;font-size: 14px; height:150px;}

    </style>
</head>

<body style="font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; margin:0px;">
	<!--- Left Side Bar Start----->	
    <div class="left-list-box">
	<div class="header-box-logo">
	<!--<img src="{{LOGO}}" width="250px" style="max-width:250px;width:100%;">-->
	<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"  style="max-width:250px;width:100%;">
	</div>
	<div class="bg-left">
        <div class="header-box-l">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64,
"  style="max-width:80px;width:100%;margin:auto;">
            <h3>No-Haggle price</h3>
            <p>Its mean the price your see on the sticker is the price you pay. No Games. No uncomfortable negotiations.</p>
			<hr/ style="background:#4a4a4a;border-color: #4a4a4a;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
        </div>
        <div class="header-box-l">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," 
			style="max-width:100px;width:100%;margin:auto;"/>
            <h3>No-Haggle Financing</h3>
            <p>We make financing easy by making your options clear and simple.</p>
			<hr/ style="background:#4a4a4a;border-color: #4a4a4a;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
        </div>
        <div class="header-box-l">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," style="max-width:100px;width:100%;margin:auto;"/>
            <h3>5-Star Google Review</h3>
            <p>The customer service is unmatched and it’s an experience that completely different than going to any other car dealership.</p>
			<hr/ style="background:#4a4a4a;border-color: #4a4a4a; margin-top:20px;">
        </div>
        <div class="header-box-l left-contact">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64,
" style="max-width:100px;width:100%;margin:auto;"/>
	<p class="header-address" style="margin-bottom:15px;">{{BADDRESS}},<br/> {{BCITY}}, {{BSTATE}} {{BCODE}}</p>
            <h4 style="margin-bottom:15px;">{{BPHONE}}</h4>
            <p>{{WEBSITE}}</p>
			<p style="padding-top: 10px;font-size: 22px;padding-bottom:12px; font-weight:600;"> SCAN ME!</p> 
			{{QR}}


        </div>
    </div>
	</div>
	<!--- Left Side Bar Close----->	
	
	<div class="right-side-bar">
	<div class="report-header-left f-left" style="width: 100%;float: left;border-bottom: 4px solid #000;min-height:80px;">
	<h4 style="font-size:35px;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;"> {{YEAR}} {{MAKE}} {{MODEL}}</h4>
                <p style="margin:0px;width:100%;"><span class="vin"><strong style="font-size: 18px;">VIN:</strong> {{VIN}}</span> <span class="stock"> <strong style="font-size: 18px;">Stock #:</strong> {{STOCK}}</span></p>                
            </div>
			
			<div class="odometer">
			<div class="odometer-inner">
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,"/>
			<h4>Odometer</h4>
			 <p>{{ODOMETER}} {{KM_MILES}}</p>
			
			</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="price">
			<div class="price-inner">
			<h3>Price</h3>
			<p><strong style="font-size:36px;padding-right: 15px;font-weight:700;">${{PRICE}}</strong></p>
                <p>+ Taxes and Licensing</p>
			</div>
			
			
			</div>
			
			<div class="vehicle-detail">
			<h3>Vehicle Details</h3>
			
			<div class="vehicle-detail-inner">
			<ul class="detail-block">
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,"/>
			<h4> Body Style </h4>
			<p> {{BODY}} </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4> Engine </h4>
			<p> {{ENGINE}} L </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4> Exterior Color: </h4>
			<p> {{EXTERIOR_COLOR}} </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4>Transmission: </h4>
			<p> {{TRANSMISSION}} </p>
			</li>
			
			
			</ul>
			
			<ul class="detail-block 2nd-row">
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4> Interior Color </h4>
			<p> {{INTERIOR_COLOR}} </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4> Drive Train </h4>
			<p> {{DRIVETRAIN}} </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4> Doors </h4>
			<p> {{DOOR}} </p>
			</li>
			<li>
			<img src="data:image/png;base64,
"/>
			<h4>Fuel Type: </h4>
			<p> {{FUEL_TYPE}} </p>
			</li>
			
			
			</ul>
			
			</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="vehicle-Description vehicle-detail">
			<h3>Vehicle Description</h3>
			<P> {{DESCRIPTION_LIMITED}}</P>
			</div>
			
			<div class="financing-option">
			<h3>Financing Option Available For All Vehicles</h3>
			<P style="font-size:11px; color:#878787;margin-top:10px; line-height:20px;"> *Every reasonable effort is made to ensure the accuracy of the information listed above. Vehicle description, pricing, incentives, options (including standard equipment), and technical specifications listed may not match the exact vehicle displayed. Some features may have been removed. Please consult with your sales associate to verify vehicle equipment and features. The payment estimator is not an advertisement or offer for specific terms of credit and actual terms may vary.Payment amounts presented are for illustrative purposes only and may not be available. Actual vehicle price may vary by Dealer.  The payment displayed does not include taxes, license and/or registration fees. Payment amount is for illustrative purposes only. Actual prices may vary by Dealer. Payment amounts may be different due to various factors such as fees, specials, rebates, term, down payment, APR, net trade-in, and applicable tax rate. Actual APR is based on available finance programs and the creditworthiness of the customer. Not all customers will qualify for credit or for the lowest rate. Please contact the dealership for actual rates, program details and actual terms.</P>
			</div>
			
			
			
	</div>
</body>

</html>